rks as expected. It’s exciting to see scripts come to life!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_xpV1vRA54kTB2gqq16ZbBl2T|fc_0fea83e6b3088d800169c41a9d5444819180ad9a7854f4f838","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/skills/llm-distillator/scripts/distill_health_response.py --context \"Synthetic workflow test. Patient reports 3 days of right flank discomfort with mild nausea, intermittent fatigue, slightly increased urination, dull pain about 4/10, not clearly positional, no fever, no vomiting, and past history of kidney stones.\" --diagnosis \"Synthetic diagnostic inputs: Urinalysis shows trace blood, leukocyte esterase negative, nitrites negative, protein negative, mildly elevated specific gravity. Blood tests show normal creatinine, normal eGFR, normal WBC, and CRP not elevated. Renal ultrasound shows mild right hydronephrosis, possible small proximal ureteral stone not directly visualized, and no renal mass seen.\"","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-patient-agent","yieldMs":30000,"timeout":120},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/skills/llm-distillator/scripts/distill_health_response.py --context \\\"Synthetic workflow test. Patient reports 3 days of right flank discomfort with mild nausea, intermittent fatigue, slightly increased urination, dull pain about 4/10, not clearly positional, no fever, no vomiting, and past history of kidney stones.\\\" --diagnosis \\\"Synthetic diagnostic inputs: Urinalysis shows trace blood, leukocyte esterase negative, nitrites negative, protein negative, mildly elevated specific gravity. Blood tests show normal creatinine, normal eGFR, normal WBC, and CRP not elevated. Renal ultrasound shows mild right hydronephrosis, possible small proximal ureteral stone not directly visualized, and no renal mass seen.\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-patient-agent\",\"yieldMs\":30000,\"timeout\":120}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"g